    "Geometry/NPCs/ladders: docs/research/raw/gms_v8/30000.json (maplestory.io /api/GMS/8/map/30000).",
    "Portals recovered from raw WZ because the parsed API JSON has null entries: https://maplestory.io/api/wz/GMS/8/Map/Map/Map0/000030000.img/portal/<n> (fields pn, pt, tm, tn, x, y). All portals here are therefore sourced, not inferred.",
    "Landmark x,y are WZ obj anchors from https://maplestory.io/api/wz/GMS/8/Map/Map/Map0/000030000.img/<layer>/obj/<n>; sprites identified via https://maplestory.io/api/wz/GMS/8/Map/Obj/<oS>.img/<l0>/<l1>/<l2>/0. API-reported sprite origins were all exactly (w/2,h/2), so treat anchors as roughly sprite-centre; footprints are +-half sprite size. Where one landmark merges several objects, x,y is their approximate mean.",
    "tiers[].y_left/y_right are MapleStory y (down is positive). Tier ids are local to this file. Ladders: y1 = top end, y2 = bottom end (raw data order); from_tier = bottom tier, to_tier = top tier.",
    "v8 has zero mob spawns in this map (life contains only NPCs).",
    "Spawn point \"sp\" at (-77,122) above G1. in00 (pt 1, tm 999999999) is arrival-only: no portal back to 20000.",
    "Reachability (inferred from the data pattern: every intended hop is 60 px up with <=12 px horizontal gap; every larger rise has a ladder/rope): main route G1 -> G2 -> G3 -> G4 -> G5 -> rope x1434 -> E1 -> rope x1359 -> E2 -> hop W to E3 -> hop W to M1 -> walk up slope M2 -> M3 -> ladder x107 -> U1 -> U2 -> U3 -> U4 -> S1 -> slope S2 -> S3 (Peter, out00). The west islet stair W1-W3 (via ladder x-136) tops out at y=-145, 300 px below M3: a dead-end side branch.",
    "M3 west face is a wall at x=-39 from y=-445 down to -300; S3 east end is a wall at x=1569 from -925 down to -780 (map edge).",
    "v22 differs (docs/research/raw/gms_v22/30000.json): E2 islet moved to x1221..1389 y-385 with rope x1342 (-383..-34); upper islets rearranged with a rope at x183 (-803..-455) replacing ladder x107; adds NPC 2004 Todd at (-21,215) and 3x mob 9300018 \"Tutorial Jr. Sentinel\" at (479,-445),(1343,215),(690,95) (https://maplestory.io/api/GMS/22/mob/9300018)."
